This month we’re continuing our series of single presenter sessions. These sessions are designed to give you deeper insights into topics and methodologies to get you up to speed faster.

This month, our presenter will bring you a first hand experience of building as a solo, hands-on CTO in startups. He’ll introduce progressing from AI prototypes to a production TypeScript Node.js platform. You’ll get an overview of how Artificial Intelligence has changed the landscape for full service CTOs.

Learn how tools and technologies change in how you use the tools once things get real.

All shaped to fit our community.
